      "id": "claim_1e1ae0709f314dbb8fc54bacbb2a78f4",
      "statement": "Evaluator.evaluate iterates dataset items through _extract_document, which times extractor.extract, compares each expected field via FieldComparisonManager (missing predicted fields count as incorrect), treats all-fields-correct as document accuracy, and assembles metrics plus per-field results into an EvaluationReport; extraction exceptions are re-raised unless skip_failures is set.",
