      "id": "claim_0025053833684f72b52c13973832224f",
      "statement": "Hallucination detection auto-selects the LLM strategy when the extractor exposes an llm and HEURISTIC otherwise, tolerating detector init failures with warnings, and document text for the checks comes from a caller-supplied document_text_provider or falls back to joining content from the extractor's document_loader.",
